# hsk action added-at

When you **add** a new tray menu action (`On*` in `actions/<section>/` and `menu_structure.py`), also refresh creation dates:

```text
hsk dev generate-action-added-at
```

This updates [`config/action_added_at.json`](config/action_added_at.json) (needed for **Newest** sorting). Existing stamps are kept; missing classes get a Git first-appearance date, or `now()` if not yet in Git history.

Do not leave new `On*` classes without an entry in `action_added_at.json`.
